title: mf log undo
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
summary: Undo a label of your newest change still standing (none named: list them)

Without a label, lists the labels your newest change still standing was written in, innermost first, and writes nothing; with one, reverts its changes still standing; `plan <label>` previews it ([[Undo and redo]], [[The undo selection]]).
